<title>SPAIN: Tabacalera confirms 78 ptas interim dividend. [CORRECTED 12:11 GMT]</title>
<headline>Tabacalera confirms 78 ptas interim dividend. [CORRECTED 12:11 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for Spain's Tabacalera confirmed press reports on Wednesday that it is to pay an interim dividend of 78 pesetas gross per share, effective January 20.</p>
<p>Last year the firm paid an interim dividend of 70 (Corrects from 60) pesetas gross.</p>
<p>The spokesman also confirmed that Antonio Vazquez Romero was named director of the group's tobacco division.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
